definition  default v3  Default pipeline
initial     intake
intake  resting
  role      —
  model     faux/faux-1 (deployment)
  skills    —
  requires  —
  exits     specifying, canceled
  asks      —
  writes    its worktree
  pushes    its own branch
specifying  working
  role      specifier
  model     faux/faux-1 (deployment)
  skills    specify
  requires  spec_doc (checked): a spec doc, gaps declared (explicitly [] when there are none)
  exits     planning, canceled
  asks      —
  writes    nothing (read-only)
  pushes    its own branch
planning  working
  role      planner
  model     faux/planner (role)
  skills    —
  requires  plan_doc (checked): a plan doc
            human_move (unchecked): a human move (B5's plan approval gate)
  exits     building [human gate: plan approval], canceled
  asks      —
  writes    nothing (read-only)
  pushes    its own branch
building  working
  role      builder
  model     faux/builder (role)
  skills    implement
  requires  run_completed (checked): a run that completed
            non_empty_diff (checked): a non-empty diff
            pr_link (checked): a PR link
  exits     review, canceled
  asks      —
  writes    its worktree
  pushes    its own branch
review  working
  role      reviewer
  model     faux/reviewer (role)
  skills    review
  requires  verified (checked): a passing verification of every surface the card's change touched
            review_verdict (checked): a review verdict
            human_merge (unchecked): a human merge (B5's merge gate)
  exits     done [human gate: merge], canceled
  asks      —
  writes    its worktree
  pushes    its own branch
done  terminal
  role      —
  model     faux/faux-1 (deployment)
  skills    —
  requires  —
  exits     —
  asks      —
  writes    its worktree
  pushes    its own branch
canceled  terminal
  role      —
  model     faux/faux-1 (deployment)
  skills    —
  requires  —
  exits     —
  asks      —
  writes    its worktree
  pushes    its own branch
